{
  "order": 3,
  "title": "Explain a policy change and what to do now",
  "audience": "Staff who skim policy documents and get caught by the change",
  "inputs": "The policy before and after, the one rule people break most (with your own number), the deadline and where to act",
  "theme": "briefing",
  "type": "geometric",
  "motion": "snappy",
  "transition": "cut",
  "sfx": "subtle",
  "texture": {
    "grain": 0.05
  },
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "policy",
      "claim": "31% of claims were returned for a missing or non-itemised receipt",
      "source": "Example Co. expense policy and 2027 claims data (sample: replace with yours)"
    }
  ],
  "note": "Policy arc: the cost of getting it wrong as your own number, the document people must get right with its parts marked, the new deadline on a calendar, the step done in the app, the line to repeat spoken over the finished step. Replace sketchText, sketchParams and sketchSay with the policy's words and figures (`clearframe sketch NAME`). See skills/clearframe-workplace/SKILL.md.",
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "block": "canvas",
      "vo": "Last year, almost a third of our expense claims came back.",
      "props": {
        "source": "Example Co. 2027 claims data",
        "chart": {
          "kind": "number",
          "values": [
            {
              "label": "of claims came back",
              "value": 31,
              "highlight": true
            }
          ],
          "suffix": "%",
          "box": [360, 300, 1200, 520]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "receipt",
      "block": "canvas",
      "vo": "Mostly for one reason. A receipt needs the place, every item, and the total. A card slip is not a receipt.",
      "props": {
        "source": "Example Co. expense policy",
        "sketch": "inspect",
        "sketchParams": {
          "marks": ["sender", "body", "link"],
          "color": "positive"
        },
        "sketchText": {
          "FROM": "Harbor Grill, 14 Dock Street",
          "SUBJECT": "Receipt #4471",
          "LINE1": "2 × lunch special  $36.00",
          "LINE2": "Tax $3.10 · Total $39.10",
          "BUTTON": "Card ending 4417",
          "MARKONE": "The place",
          "MARKTWO": "Every item",
          "MARKTHREE": "Not just the card slip"
        },
        "sketchSay": {
          "ONE": "place",
          "TWO": "item",
          "THREE": "card"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "deadline",
      "block": "canvas",
      "vo": "And the window is shorter now. From the day you spend, you have thirty days to claim, not sixty.",
      "props": {
        "source": "Example Co. expense policy",
        "sketch": "deadline",
        "sketchParams": {
          "days": 31,
          "firstWeekday": 3,
          "start": 1,
          "end": 30,
          "today": 0
        },
        "sketchText": {
          "MONTH": "March",
          "OPENS": "You spend",
          "CLOSES": "Last day to claim"
        },
        "sketchSay": {
          "OPEN": "spend",
          "CLOSE": "thirty"
        }
      },
      "hold": 1.2
    }
  ],
  "endings": [
    {
      "name": "app-then-object",
      "about": "the step done in the app on a desktop, then the film’s own object changed (a cast close).",
      "beats": [
        {
          "id": "step",
          "block": "canvas",
          "vo": "The app does the work. Open New claim, snap the receipt, check the amount, and submit.",
          "props": {
            "sketch": "portal",
            "sketchText": {
              "APP": "Example Co. Expenses",
              "STEP1": "New claim",
              "STEP2": "Snap a receipt",
              "OTHER": "Mileage",
              "FIELD": "Amount",
              "OLD": "$0.00",
              "NEW": "$39.10",
              "DONE": "Submitted: paid in about 5 business days"
            },
            "sketchSay": {
              "CLICK1": "New",
              "CLICK2": "snap",
              "CHANGE": "amount",
              "SAVE": "submit"
            }
          },
          "transition": "cut"
        },
        {
          "id": "close",
          "block": "canvas",
          "vo": "Itemised. Within thirty days. In the app.",
          "props": {
            "cast": {
              "look": "tiles",
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "receipt",
                  "shape": "receipt",
                  "color": "surface",
                  "label": "Itemised",
                  "enter": "pop"
                },
                {
                  "id": "cal",
                  "shape": "calendar",
                  "color": "accent",
                  "label": "Within 30 days",
                  "enter": "pop"
                },
                {
                  "id": "phone",
                  "shape": "phone",
                  "color": "accent2",
                  "label": "In the app",
                  "enter": "pop"
                }
              ],
              "formations": [
                {
                  "form": "line",
                  "say": "Itemised",
                  "ids": ["receipt"]
                },
                {
                  "form": "line",
                  "say": "Within",
                  "ids": ["receipt", "cal"]
                },
                {
                  "form": "line",
                  "say": "app",
                  "ids": ["receipt", "cal", "phone"]
                },
                {
                  "form": "mark",
                  "mark": "circle",
                  "ids": ["phone"],
                  "say": "app"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "transition": "cut"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "slip-or-receipt",
      "about": "the card slip and the itemised receipt side by side: the slip steps up with only its total, then the receipt steps forward as the one to snap, with where and by when said over it.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "id": "which",
          "block": "canvas",
          "transition": "cut",
          "vo": "A card slip only shows the total. The itemised receipt shows the place and every item. Snap that one, in the Expenses app, within 30 days.",
          "props": {
            "source": "Example Co. expense policy",
            "cast": {
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "slip",
                  "shape": "ticket",
                  "color": "muted",
                  "label": "Card slip",
                  "enter": "none",
                  "size": 210
                },
                {
                  "id": "itemised",
                  "shape": "receipt",
                  "color": "accent",
                  "label": "Itemised receipt",
                  "enter": "none",
                  "size": 210
                }
              ],
              "formations": [
                {
                  "form": "line",
                  "at": 0,
                  "ids": ["slip", "itemised"]
                },
                {
                  "form": "hero",
                  "hero": "slip",
                  "say": "total",
                  "word": "Only the total"
                },
                {
                  "form": "hero",
                  "hero": "itemised",
                  "say": "place"
                },
                {
                  "form": "exit",
                  "ids": ["slip"],
                  "say": "Snap"
                },
                {
                  "form": "camera",
                  "zoom": 0.95,
                  "dur": 1.2,
                  "ease": "out",
                  "say": "Snap"
                },
                {
                  "form": "camera",
                  "zoom": 0.88,
                  "dur": 1.6,
                  "ease": "out",
                  "say": "within"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "phone-then-window",
      "about": "the claim done on a phone in one sentence, then the month’s calendar again with today marked and the last day circled, the action said over it.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "id": "snap",
          "block": "canvas",
          "transition": "cut",
          "hold": 0.6,
          "vo": "In the Expenses app on your phone, tap New claim, snap the receipt, check the amount, and submit. Do it the day you spend.",
          "props": {
            "source": "Example Co. expense policy",
            "sketch": "portal",
            "sketchParams": {
              "device": "phone"
            },
            "sketchText": {
              "APP": "Example Co. Expenses",
              "STEP1": "New claim",
              "STEP2": "Snap a receipt",
              "OTHER": "Mileage",
              "FIELD": "Amount",
              "OLD": "$0.00",
              "NEW": "$39.10",
              "DONE": "Submitted for approval"
            },
            "sketchSay": {
              "CLICK1": "New",
              "CLICK2": "snap",
              "CHANGE": "amount",
              "SAVE": "submit"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "window",
          "block": "canvas",
          "transition": "cut",
          "vo": "Spent on March 1st? The 30th is your last day. Today is the 12th, so claim it now.",
          "props": {
            "source": "Example Co. expense policy",
            "sketch": "deadline",
            "sketchParams": {
              "days": 31,
              "firstWeekday": 3,
              "start": 1,
              "end": 30,
              "today": 12
            },
            "sketchText": {
              "MONTH": "March",
              "OPENS": "You spend",
              "CLOSES": "Last day to claim",
              "TODAY": "Today"
            },
            "sketchSay": {
              "OPEN": "1st",
              "CLOSE": "30th",
              "TODAY": "Today"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
